LCC2 Data Organization Format:
Data Organization Format originated from XGRIDS. lcc-playable reads scene data in the
LCC2 Data Organization Format (the .lcc2 file, its .sog splat files and PLY meshes) and
uses it under authorization from XGRIDS pursuant to the LCC2 White Paper
(https://github.com/xgrids/LCC2Whitepaper), whose terms apply to the format. XGRIDS and
its affiliates own and retain all intellectual property and other rights in the Data
Organization Format. Without the prior written consent of XGRIDS, the Data Organization
Format may not be used for training or fine-tuning any artificial intelligence model
that competes, directly or indirectly, with XGRIDS products or services. Games built
with lcc-playable show the line "Data Organization Format originated from XGRIDS" on
the loading screen and on every card, and `npm run build` writes these notices to
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.

